  "rt-blog-html": "\n          <p id>For several years now, internet users have been able to leave reviews of the places they’ve visited. And restaurants are no exception! After their visit, customers leave comments full of enthusiasm, sincerity, or humor—and some are downright hilarious. The Instagram account @desjoursetdesavis collects the most original, funniest, or offbeat Google reviews to share these little internet gems with us. We had fun selecting the funniest Google reviews of restaurants. And one thing’s for sure: judging by these comments, some dining experiences are true culinary adventures! For restaurant owners who want to enhance their customers’ experience, <a href=\"/en/self-ordering-kiosk\">a self-service kiosk to improve the customer experience</a> is often the first step toward smoother service.</p>\n          <p id>‍</p>\n          <h2 id><strong id>Google and TripAdvisor reviews from customers who are really unhappy (and it's hilarious!)</strong></h2>\n          <p id>Poorly cooked food, mediocre service, or exorbitant prices… Google reviews can also reveal negative experiences had by dissatisfied customers. In these cases, customers don’t hesitate to leave highly critical and blunt reviews. We had a blast compiling the best Google and TripAdvisor reviews from customers who were unhappy after dining at these restaurants. And when they’re not satisfied, some don’t hesitate to let everyone know.</p>\n          <blockquote id>As Jean-Pierre Coffe used to say: “That’s crap!”</blockquote>\n          <p id>In all subjectivity of course!</p>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>A beautiful pen</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt=\"Google restaurant reviews\" src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe83f_6436cddf51332f6995b8a340_1.Une%2520belle%2520plume.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Kidnapping</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt=\"Google restaurant reviews\" src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe811_6436ce03492d0d23e4798565_2.le%2520kidnapping.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Good cancer to all&nbsp;</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe823_6436ce1385c9409e5d7ab1cd_3.Bon%2520cancer%2520%25C3%25A0%2520tous%2520.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Pastis = wanker</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe81a_6436ce696b8dbce2a0e255d9_4.pastis%2520%253D%2520branleur.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Disaster area</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe807_6436ce7e762a5bce8ee4002a_2.zone%2520sinistr%25C3%25A9e.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>When Taylor Swift comes to the restaurant</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665746ba32e72207ffe7f7_6436ce966e795d2437cf1534_6.taylor%2520swift.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Nice ski vacations</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665746ba32e72207ffe7f4_6436cee67feba23a8b8077cf_7.sympa%2520les%2520vacances%2520au%2520ski.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Probably a customer from Marseille</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe831_6436cefd3dff3d45c10e6e88_8.s%25C3%25BBrement%2520un%2520marseillais....png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Freshness of life</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe81d_6436cf35c4449b2eb9d301d1_9.fra%25C3%25AEcheur%2520de%2520vivre.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>It takes away your appetite</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe814_6436cf49c4449b86ded30247_10.%25C3%25A7a%2520coupe%2520l%2527appetit.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p id>‍</p>\n          <h2 id><strong id>The best restaurant punchlines&nbsp;</strong></h2>\n          <p id>Online, the review war is raging… On the other side of the ring, restaurant owners are brimming with creativity and quick wit as they respond—with a touch of humor—to Google reviews from unhappy customers. We’ve had a blast selecting the cream of the crop: the best comebacks from restaurant owners who won’t take any nonsense! As a result, it’s full of punchlines—and it’s not always exactly fair play. We love it!</p>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>The playground</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe83c_6436cf61ccb3e16fbcd8ff94_1.La%2520cour%2520de%2520r%25C3%25A9cr%25C3%25A9.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Thank you Véronique</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665746ba32e72207ffe7ee_6436cf6cef56507767888ac1_2.Merci%2520V%25C3%25A9ronique.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>An honest restaurant owner</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe801_6436cf9bcf301e3294d9905c_3.Un%2520restaurateur%2520honn%25C3%25AAte.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Violence</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665746ba32e72207ffe7f1_6436cfa9a9abfedc0dc04500_4.La%2520violence.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>5 stars for boldness</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe820_6436cfbf762a5b21dee41b78_5.5%2520etoiles%2520pour%2520l%2527audace.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Mirror my beautiful mirror</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe82e_6436cfd263b289914a4bbcf8_6.Mon%2520beau%2520miroir.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Sorry for all the Timothy's</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe85a_6436cff0bb7b38aa773e8c96_7.d%25C3%25A9sol%25C3%25A9%2520pour%2520tous%2520les%2520Timoth%25C3%25A9e.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>We don't have a lot of</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe839_6436d000cbc184bdb7d090ed_8.on%2520nem%2520beaucoup.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>With the right hashtag</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe80a_6436d019bb7b38e92e3e90c7_9.avec%2520le%2520hashtag%2520.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>On the menu: Croque-madame</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe804_6436d039a9abfe6502c050e5_10.au%2520menu%2520croque%2520madame.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1040px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1040px\"><a href=\"/en/ebook/developper-son-fast-food-le-guide-ultime\" target=\"_blank\">\n              <div><img alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/655f7d9f44ef43bed9fe6995_Banni%C3%A8re%20Blog%20-%20guide%20ultime%20(1).jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n            </a></figure>\n          <p>‍</p>\n          <h2 id><strong id>The 15 funniest Google reviews</strong></h2>\n          <p id>If there were a contest for the funniest Google reviews, these customers would surely win the Palme d’Or! Google restaurant reviews can be a real goldmine for a good laugh. Between the amusing reviews, the passionate critiques, and the surprising comments, we’re always blown away by these customers’ genius! Thanks again to the Instagram account @desjoursetdesavis for sharing these little gems with us! We love having a good laugh reading this collection of the funniest Google reviews from restaurant customers.</p>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>All our thoughts to the bald guy</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe95f_6436d0d5f1757622bf46c55a_1.toutes%2520nos%2520pensees%2520au%2520mec%2520chauve.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p id>‍</p>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Benjamin Button at the restaurant</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe9a5_6436d05f51332f8058b8cf4e_2.Benjamin%2520Button%2520au%2520resto.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Fuck the pizza</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe96c_6436d075b1a2ec750c7a39a4_3.nique%2520la%2520pizza.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Just like at home</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665749ba32e72207ffe92c_6436d08b3dff3d841d0e8a0a_4.Comme%2520%25C3%25A0%2520la%2520maison.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Get him out of here</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665749ba32e72207ffe92f_6436d094fd9f4b7f17c171a9_5.sortez-le%2520d%2527ici.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>The waiter's fries</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665749ba32e72207ffe929_6436d0b263b28930894bd104_6.La%2520frite%2520du%2520serveur.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>We apologize to all bald people</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe94c_6436d055257d677334d1b110_7.On%2520s%2527excuse%2520pour%2520tous%2520les%2520chauves.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Zemmour</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665749ba32e72207ffe932_6436d11863b28931b24bd94a_8.Zemmour%2520.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>The math teacher at the restaurant</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665749ba32e72207ffe935_6436d137e68a0e52d275b427_9.Le%2520prof%2520de%2520maths%2520au%2520resto.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>A very hot service</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe959_6436d158cbc184a6f1d0a83f_10.un%2520service%2520tres%2520hot%2520.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>&nbsp;A server with a heart</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe9a8_6436d16d7feba20a93809b29_11.un%2520serveur%2520qui%2520a%2520du%2520coeur.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>&nbsp;Mental health of servers</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe95c_6436d1932e98f6870612f364_12.la%2520sant%25C3%25A9%2520mentale%2520des%2520serveurs%2520c%2527est%2520important.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>&nbsp;But not enough to deserve 5 stars</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe9ab_6436d1a1ce4ef83182b1299d_13.mais%2520pas%2520assez%2520pour%25205%2520etoiles%2520tout%2520les%2520moyens%2520sont%2520bons%2520pour%2520attirer%2520la%2520clientele%2520.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>&nbsp;Poor Axel</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe956_6436d1ae6007d4f5ca36f8f3_14.pauvre%2520axel.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>&nbsp;A client poet</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe96f_6436d1c8ce4ef8005bb12c3d_15.un%2520client%2520po%25C3%25A8te.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <p id>‍</p>\n          <h2 id><strong id>The best reviews from customers who like to drink</strong></h2>\n          <p id>Finally, we couldn't overlook the Google reviews from customers who had a little too much to drink. It's really funny! Because, yes, customers love to eat at restaurants, but some of them love to drink, too—maybe a little too much!*</p>\n          <p id><em id>*Please remember that excessive alcohol consumption is harmful to your health; it is important to drink in moderation and not to exceed your limits!&nbsp;</em></p>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Thirsty beer</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe975_6436d1d28bce50e1f520383a_1.La%2520bi%25C3%25A8re%2520de%2520soif.jpeg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Disaster area</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/68665747ba32e72207ffe807_6436ce7e762a5bce8ee4002a_2.zone%2520sinistr%25C3%25A9e.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>In cosmic denial</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe978_6436d1ffcbc1847d7bd0b147_3.un%2520client%2520dans%2520le%2520d%25C3%25A9ni.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>That's for sure</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe9b1_6436d210c8c9ca397c028edd_4.C%2527est%2520certain.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n          <ul id>\n            <li id>Not before noon</li>\n          </ul>\n          <figure id class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\">\n            <div id><img id alt src=\"/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/6866574aba32e72207ffe972_6436d223257d67bc14d1ce0c_5.Pas%2520avant%2520midi.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div>\n          </figure>\n        ",
